                        <p style="color:#666;margin:0 0 10px 0;font-size:14px;">Here are your upcoming incomes and expenses for the next @ReminderDays days.</p>
                        <p style="color:#999;font-size:13px;margin:0 0 4px 0;">Generated: @GeneratedDateTime.ToString("ddd, dd MMM yyyy, h:mm tt")</p>
                        <p style="color:#999;font-size:13px;margin:0;">Last logged in: @LastLoggedInUtc.ToString("ddd, dd MMM yyyy, h:mm tt")</p>
                    </div>

